## 三、Service 方法

```kotlin
class UserService(
    private val userRepository: UserRepository,
) {
    private val logger = LoggerFactory.getLogger(javaClass)

    /**
     * 创建用户。邮箱重复返回业务错误码 2001。
     */
    suspend fun create(req: CreateUserRequest): UserResponse {
        require(req.email.isNotBlank()) { "email required" }
        require(req.password.length >= 6) { "password too short" }

        val existing = userRepository.findByEmail(req.email)
        if (existing != null) {
            throw BusinessException(code = 2001, message = "email already used")
        }

        val passwordHash = BCrypt.hashpw(req.password, BCrypt.gensalt())
        val user = userRepository.create(
            User(username = req.username, email = req.email),
            passwordHash = passwordHash,
        )
        logger.info("user created: {}", user.id)
        return user.toResponse()
    }
}
```

约定：

- Service 方法签名清晰：参数是 Request 或基础类型，返回是 Response 或领域对象
- 业务规则集中：参数校验 → 业务前置检查 → Repository 调用 → 后置处理
- 错误抛 `IllegalArgumentException` / `BusinessException` / `NotFoundException`，不返回 null 表达失败

